            </note>
            <note corresp="#d488-f4" n="4" xml:id="d488-f4-content">
                <p>Treaty of Non-Aggression, signed July 8, 1937, by Afghanistan, Iraq, Iran, and
                    Turkey; for text, see League of Nations Treaty Series, vol. <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">cxc</hi>, p. 21.</p>
            </note>
